Item 34 ratified an OPEN recommendation that explicitly included the token inventory, though later decisions changed several constructs that use those tokens. Q9.1 fixes Core reads without fixing source spelling. R-0600 has conflicting schedule entries, and the TOML decisions leave key schema choices open. I’ll distinguish those gaps from settled rules.
